1096
00:36:56,167 --> 00:36:57,167
- A dollar and a quarter.

1097
00:36:59,267 --> 00:37:01,067
(door opens)
- Here's a toenail.

1098
00:37:01,067 --> 00:37:02,300
(door closes)

1099
00:37:02,300 --> 00:37:03,233
- [Brute Man] Go away.

1100
00:37:03,233 --> 00:37:04,700
- [Mike] Have a nice day.

1101
00:37:06,233 --> 00:37:08,667
- [Tom] Shucks, I guess
no one likes me today.

1102
00:37:08,667 --> 00:37:09,600
