1104
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,200
(door opens)

1105
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:17,100
(door creaking)

1106
00:37:17,100 --> 00:37:18,300
- [Mike] I really
shouldn't do this when I'm

1107
00:37:18,300 --> 00:37:19,200
on the crapper.

1108
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:23,600
(door creaking)

1109
00:37:23,600 --> 00:37:25,000
- [Tom] Man, this
menu's hard to read.

1110
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:27,533
