1132
00:38:21,667 --> 00:38:23,500
(ominous orchestral music)

1133
00:38:23,500 --> 00:38:24,500
- [Mike] Okay you're there.

1134
00:38:24,500 --> 00:38:25,967
Stay out of your own head, now,

1135
00:38:25,967 --> 00:38:28,667
hands up to ten and two,
into the creeping position.

1136
00:38:29,600 --> 00:38:31,200
