be crotchety sometime.

1161
00:39:18,033 --> 00:39:20,333
- [Mike] Oh man, she's
a fine piece of woman.

1162
00:39:21,700 --> 00:39:22,800
- [Crow] God is dead?

1163
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:23,833
Good! Ha!

1164
00:39:23,833 --> 00:39:26,167
(ominous orchestral music)

1165
00:39:26,167 --> 00:39:27,133
- [Tom] Ha, look at that.

1166
00:39:27,133 --> 00:39:28,567
Philanthropist laid.

1167
00:39:28,567 --> 00:39:30,200
It's always a philanthropist.

1168
00:39:30,200 --> 00:39:33,100
Rock stars and
philanthropists, wow.

1169
00:39:34,233 --> 00:39:36,333
- [Mike] Erma Bombeck
has a good point.

1170
00:39:37,200 --> 00:39:39,200
(ominous orchestral music)

1171
00:39:39,200 --> 00:39:42,000
- [Crow] How about Captain
Flash or Captain Rocket?

1172
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:43,267
Captain M.J. Donelly
just doesn't do it

1173
00:39:43,267 --> 00:39:44,833
