1174
00:39:44,833 --> 00:39:45,933
(door closes)

1175
00:39:45,933 --> 00:39:47,800
How are things in homicide?

1176
00:39:47,800 --> 00:39:49,300
- Good morning, Captain.

1177
00:39:49,300 --> 00:39:50,733
- I'll bet you think it's good.

1178
00:39:50,733 --> 00:39:51,900
- [Tom] You.

1179
00:39:51,900 --> 00:39:53,133
- But does that
beaming purse of yours

1180
00:39:53,133 --> 00:39:54,033
