some good news?

1181
00:39:54,033 --> 00:39:56,067
- Huh-uh, bad news.

1182
00:39:56,067 --> 00:39:57,200
Its on the way.

1183
00:39:57,200 --> 00:39:58,867
I just saw
Commissioner Salisbury

1184
00:39:58,867 --> 00:40:00,467
parking his car outside.

1185
00:40:00,467 --> 00:40:02,300
The mayor's secretary
is with him.

1186
00:40:02,300 --> 00:40:03,567
Just thought I'd let
you know, give you

1187
00:40:03,567 --> 00:40:05,600
at least two minutes to
think up a good story.

1188
00:40:05,600 --> 00:40:06,767
- [Mike] Nah, nah, nah.

1189
00:40:06,767 --> 00:40:08,533
- Hold it, Lieutenant,
come back here.

1190
00:40:09,667 --> 00:40:10,500
- Who, me?

1191
00:40:10,500 --> 00:40:11,933
- Yeah, you.

1192
00:40:11,933 --> 00:40:13,400
- [Crow] Who put the
cookie in the cookie jar?

1193
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:16,200
- After all, I assigned
you to the creeper murders,

1194
00:40:16,200 --> 00:40:19,533
and I need a partner in this
little game of buck passing.

1195
00:40:19,533 --> 00:40:22,200
By the way, just what
have you done toward

1196
00:40:22,200 --> 00:40:23,367
apprehending the murderer?

1197
00:40:23,367 --> 00:40:24,300
- Are you kidding?

1198
00:40:24,300 --> 00:40:25,500
You know what we've done.

1199
00:40:25,500 --> 00:40:26,733
We're operating
the biggest dragnet

1200
00:40:26,733 --> 00:40:28,000
in the history of
crime in this city.

1201
00:40:28,000 --> 00:40:28,800
- Well, it isn't big
enough, you haven't

1202
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:29,667
caught the creeper yet.

1203
00:40:29,667 --> 00:40:31,133
(door opens)

1204
00:40:31,133 --> 00:40:32,367
I want every available
man in the homicide burrow

1205
00:40:32,367 --> 00:40:33,333
put to work on this
case immediately.

1206
00:40:33,333 --> 00:40:34,167
- Now wait, I--

1207
00:40:34,167 --> 00:40:35,433
- I don't want excuses.

1208
00:40:35,433 --> 00:40:37,567
I want the creeper in
jail within 24 hours,

1209
00:40:37,567 --> 00:40:39,633
