changes made around here.

1210
00:40:39,633 --> 00:40:40,833
- [Tom] Yeah, midgets.

1211
00:40:40,833 --> 00:40:41,800
- Oh, good morning,
Commissioner.

1212
00:40:41,800 --> 00:40:43,133
Good morning, Mr. Parkington.

1213
00:40:43,133 --> 00:40:44,033
- Good morning.

1214
00:40:44,033 --> 00:40:45,233
- Captain Donelly.

1215
00:40:45,233 --> 00:40:47,300
- Your looking
fine, Commissioner.

1216
00:40:47,300 --> 00:40:48,533
And how's the Missus?

1217
00:40:48,533 --> 00:40:50,600
I trust she's feeling
as good you look.

1218
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:52,200
- She's not, she's
scared to death

1219
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:53,700
like every other woman in town,

1220
00:40:53,700 --> 00:40:56,700
since wholesale murder has
the peace departments stymied.

1221
00:40:56,700 --> 00:40:59,000
- I presume you refer
to the creeper murders.

1222
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:00,400
- You presume right.

1223
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:02,233
I've come here to
find out why a killer

1224
00:41:02,233 --> 00:41:04,033
