1225
00:41:04,033 --> 00:41:06,433
while the police department
twiddles its thumbs.

1226
00:41:06,433 --> 00:41:08,267
- Oh, well, now, I
wouldn't exactly call

1227
00:41:08,267 --> 00:41:09,967
